WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.400
This is where GCC matters.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.185
Because Learn's sentence
covers the product,

3
00:00:05.185 --> 00:00:09.099
every preview feature's GCC
availability is not yet specified,

4
00:00:09.099 --> 00:00:12.712
and the kit's table lists them
with the guide's interim path.

5
00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:16.851
Registered devices: use joined
or hybrid joined devices.

6
00:00:16.851 --> 00:00:18.943
The cloud firewall for clients:

7
00:00:18.943 --> 00:00:22.887
block QUIC with an Intune-delivered
Windows Firewall rule.

8
00:00:22.887 --> 00:00:26.712
The Explicit Forward Proxy:
acquire with the client only.

9
00:00:26.712 --> 00:00:30.850
HTTP method filtering:
filter by category and name.

10
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:34.650
Custom Private Access
profiles: per-app applications.

11
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:38.450
Enriched log categories: not
exported without a decision.

12
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:42.137
A decision that uses one without
an approved exception fails,

13
00:00:42.137 --> 00:00:44.520
and the finding says what to do instead.
